 -Oui. 
 
 -Hm. 

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:19.200 size:41% position:21% line:95%
 -Naturellement, 

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:22.960 size:44% position:22% line:95%
 c'est l'enfance, 
 l'adolescence... 

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:24.400 size:20% position:10% line:95%
 Oui... 

